# docs-src build outputs — the sources (md/mjs/html/py) are tracked so they
# survive a sandbox revert; generated binaries are not, since they're large
# and regenerable. Tutorial screenshots ARE tracked despite being
# regenerable in principle: capturing them correctly took several rounds of
# debugging (scoping, language cascade, sign-out timing), so checkpointing
# the result is cheaper than re-deriving it after another revert.
docs-src/**/*.docx
docs-src/**/*.pdf
docs-src/**/spec-*.md
docs-src/**/spec-pandoc.docx
docs-src/**/spec-styled.docx
docs-src/**/*.log
